*> PLB-C041 write-from-truncation: WRITE or REWRITE FROM an item
*> longer than the record. READ INTO a shorter item is not reported.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. WRITEFROM.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT OUT-FILE ASSIGN TO OUTFILE.
    SELECT CARD-FILE ASSIGN TO CARDS.
DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD  OUT-FILE.
01  OUT-REC             PIC X(80).
FD  CARD-FILE.
01  CARD-REC            PIC X(80).
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  WS-LONG-LINE        PIC X(100) VALUE SPACES.
01  WS-SHORT-LINE       PIC X(60) VALUE SPACES.
01  WS-PARMS            PIC X(21).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    OPEN OUTPUT OUT-FILE
    OPEN INPUT CARD-FILE
    WRITE OUT-REC FROM WS-LONG-LINE
    WRITE OUT-REC FROM WS-SHORT-LINE
    READ CARD-FILE INTO WS-PARMS
        AT END DISPLAY "NO CARD"
    END-READ
    DISPLAY WS-PARMS
    CLOSE OUT-FILE CARD-FILE
    STOP RUN.
